## Log:
##
## 13-Jan-2021 (v0.1): Log of this file started.
## 		Added the initial patterns:
##
## 9-May-2023 (v0.2): Added directory src2 towards ICNNA 2.0
##
## 25-Mar-2026 (v0.3): Added project-local CLAUDE.md
##
## 14-Apr-2026 (v0.4): FOE/Claude
##     + Narrowed claude/** exclusion: claude/README.md and
##       claude/.gitignore are publicly tracked.
##       All other claude/ subfolders (memory/, minutes/,
##       prompts/, state/, media/) remain private
##       (OneDrive-only).
##     + (Reverted 10-May-2026: minutes were originally made
##       public but FOE decided they should remain private.
##       Negation rules for claude/minutes/ removed.)
##
## 20-Apr-2026 (v0.5): FOE/Claude
##     + Added claude/archive/ to .gitignore. Superseded
##       artefacts archived here (OneDrive-only, not tracked).
##       Long-term plan: project-root /archive/ (Option A).
##
## 1-Jul-2026 (v0.6): FOE/Claude
##     + Added .claude/ (Claude Code harness folder, e.g.
##       settings.local.json). Machine-local, not synced;
##       distinct from the OneDrive-synced claude/ context
##       folder above.
##
## 3-Jul-2026 (v0.7): FOE/Claude
##     + Made the claude/ collaboration layer fully git-private:
##       removed the tracked exceptions for claude/README.md and
##       claude/.gitignore (the folder is OneDrive-synced, not
##       published). AI assistance is now disclosed via a
##       "## Use of AI" section in the main README.md instead of
##       an in-repo signpost. claude/.gitignore deleted (vestigial;
##       claude/** already excludes the folder); claude/README.md
##       untracked but kept locally.
##
## 16-Jul-2026 (v0.8): FOE/Claude
##     + Added scratchpad/ as a guardrail. Throwaway experiment
##       scaffolding (e.g. the dummy classes used to probe MATLAB
##       save/load semantics) lives here and must never reach
##       history. A scratchpad may survive several sessions while
##       a conceptual process is in flight, but never a commit:
##       commits do not cut through a conceptual process. Claude
##       clears it automatically once the process closes, after
##       confirming with FOE (less error-prone than a manual sweep).
##
## 7-Jul-2026 (v0.8): FOE/Claude
##     + Activated project-root /archive/ as the long-term home for
##       superseded source files (OneDrive-synced, not published to
##       git). Previously only a short-term claude/archive/ existed
##       for collaboration artefacts; /archive/ extends this to
##       source code backups.
##     + Added *.asv (MATLAB Editor autosave backups) and *.old
##       (manual source backups) to exclusions. First use:
##       guiExperimentSpace.m.old archived; guiManualIntegrity.asv
##       deleted.
##
